    "player_race_description.starwars": "A new universe free from the scourge of the Yuuzhen Vong. There are opportunities here to be leveraged.",
    "player_faction_description.imperial": "The Emperor called for our best and brightest to be evacuated in a last ditch effort to at least allow part of our citizenry to survive the onslaught from that terrible scrouge of repugnant technophobes. They cannot follow us here. We will grow stronger and conquer this weak place full of futile resistance and infantile machinations. Long live the Empire!",
    "player_race_name.zann": "Independent Traders",
    "player_faction_name.zann": "Independent Traders",
    "player_faction_description.zann": "Our galaxy was doomed when the Yuuzhen Vong appeared. The Empire and even Rebels set aside their differences to fight this threat. They failed. The Emperor fled after betraying the Rebel Alliance, taking only those he deemed worthy of saving. We will not forget. We will not forgive.",
  
